From 791ecdc9bc3570c9a7764d86c76744ea968b453a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: banexxl <damjanovic.branislav@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 20:28:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Migrate off Supabase + Upstash to self-hosted Postgres +
 Redis

Data layer: replace @supabase/supabase-js with Prisma against the shared
self-hosted `lda` Postgres. Public reads run via asAnon, questions via asService
(src/lib/db/*). Service mappers and return shapes are unchanged; relation fields
in the schema are named to match the existing PostgREST embed names.

Rate limiting: replace @upstash/ratelimit with an ioredis sliding-window limiter
on the platform Redis (src/utils/rate-limiter.ts), same limit(id) interface,
fails open if Redis is unreachable.

Deploy: add standalone Dockerfile (build-time DB via BuildKit secret, for the
prerendered activity/project pages) + docker-entrypoint.sh + .dockerignore and a
Forgejo deploy workflow. next.config media host -> s3.mrbigs.cloud, output standalone.
Point the question-notification email link at the new dashboard host.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019t1K8jwrAW6dwxWqxJK4hf
